.TH P256 2
.SH NAME
p256: ecdsa_verify, ecdh_new, ecdh_shared, oncurve \- NIST P-256 curve operations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.EX
include "keyring.m";
include "p256.m";
p256 := load P256 P256->PATH;

init:         fn(): string;
ecdsa_verify: fn(hash, r, s, pub: array of byte): int;
ecdh_new:     fn(): (array of byte, array of byte);
ecdh_shared:  fn(priv, peerpub: array of byte): array of byte;
oncurve:      fn(pub: array of byte): int;
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B P256
implements NIST elliptic-curve operations: ECDSA signature
verification (P-256 and P-384) and ECDH key agreement (P-256). It is pure
