can complete ECDHE-ECDSA handshakes and verify ECDSA certificate
chains, which is what the modern web (and every public DoH resolver)
requires.
.PP
.B Init
must be called once. Points crossing this interface use the SEC1
uncompressed encoding
.RB ( 0x04
followed by the 32-byte
